\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Paper (watermarks: similar in design and proportions, but with prominent sewing dots, to Piccard Anker II.182, 200) [K. S.: two watermarks: anchor (Anker): watermark twins (A1 and A2): Anker (A1): =\~WZIS NL0360-PO-117672 (1457, Culemborg), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117715 (1458, Frankfurt am Main), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117711 (1458, Frankfurt am Main), =\~WZIS DE4500-PO-117685 (1459, Frankfurt, Main), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117720 (1459, Frankfurt am Main), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117713 (1459, Frankfurt am Main), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117717 (1459, Frankfurt am Main) and Anker (A2): =\~WZIS NL0360-PO-117701 (1457, Culemborg), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117714 (1458, Frankfurt am Main), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117709 (1458, Frankfurt am Main), =\~WZIS EE7185-PO-117692 (1459, Reval), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117730 (1459, o. O.), =\~WZIS DE2730-PO-117729 (1459, Frankfurt am Main)]   \u183 \'b7   ff. iii (paper) + 20 + iii (paper), 285 x 210 (228 x 140) mm; I\endash II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22    \u183 \'b7   [K. S.: quire formula: 2 V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]   \u183 \'b7   catchword, with flourishes on both sides, along lower edge in center, f. 10v   \u183 \'b7   [K. S.: modern pencil foliation (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 1\endash 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; ff. 16\endash 20 unnumbered)   \u183 \'b7   writing area: 214\endash 223 x 141\endash 144]   \u183 \'b7   37\endash 45 long lines, frame-ruled in hard point   \u183 \'b7   written in elegant b\u226 \'e2tarde [K. S.: combination of bastarda with loops and bastarda without loops] by a single scribe, [K. S.: marginal notes in a cursive hand (same scribe or contemporary]   \u183 \'b7   heading, f. 1r, in red; outline of initial, incomplete, occurs at beginning of text, f. 1v. [K. S.: initial on f. 1r not executed.]}

