\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 15r\endash 239r \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Herolt (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \ldblquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Discipulus\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \rdblquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ):\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Sermones dominicales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Prologue: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad honorem dei et beate Marie virginis et omnium sanctorum et utilitatem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (f. 15v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 invocari veni sancte spiritus et cetera.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ecce rex tuus venit tibi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 [Zach. 9.9; Mat. 21.5]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hodie mater ecclesia jncipit tempus adventus Christi sicut incarnatus est et descendit de celis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad quintum vel sextum chorum angelorum pervenire poterimus et sic est finis huius operis et cetera.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Colophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit manuale sermonum discipuli collectum ex sermonibus cuiusdem discipuli de tempore anno 1444\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  [K. S.: Kaeppeli no. 2387 (MS mentioned with old number 91).] With one sermon selected from his Sermones de tempore for each Sunday; in some instances the exordium of the sermon has been abridged. Many manuscripts and early printed editions. Beginning on f. 167v sermons are numbered sporadically, 48\endash 66, in Arabic numerals by contemporary hands.}

