\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 9v\endash 10r \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si scire desideras in quo signo zodiaci et quotto gradu ipsius sit sol quocumque die anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si scire volueris quocumque die anni in quo signo sit luna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  Explanations for locating the position of the sun and of the moon in the zodiac according to the calendar on ff. 3r\endash 9r (respectively in the first and second columns to the right after the saints), and, for the moon, also according to the table on f. 9v.}

