\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 f. 11rv Explanation for determining the moveable feasts of Septuagesima Sunday, Quadragesima Sunday, Easter, summer Ember days, and Pentecost by means of the \ldblquote claves terminorum\rdblquote  marked on the calendar and the first table on f. 10v, with the verses \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In Iano prima supremaque marte secunda. Aprilis trina ergo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 anno serat et ultima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  and \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Terminus et festum numquam celebratur ibidem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 /\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Proxima sed post hunc diem lux dat tibi festum.}

