\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 11v\endash 12r Explanation for determining conjunctions (new moon) and oppositions (full moon) of the sun and the moon according to the first 8 columns in the calendar, beginning with the year 1436, followed by another rule, given in the first person (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ego posui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sum expertus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  obmitto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), for arriving at a more precise determination of the duration of the conjunction or opposition.}

