\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 171r\endash 173v 35 articles of erroneous dogmatic teaching of the Greek church. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Secuntur errores Grecorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nouerunt vniuersi christiani et presertim sedis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 apostolice domini nostri pape Eugenij beatissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primus articulus et error grecorum est iste quod in ista comprehensibilitate trinitate et sanctissima Spiritus sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tricesimus quintus Quod sacrificie eliemosyne orationes non prosunt defunctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 seculo merentur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  35 articles of erroneous dogmatic teaching of the Greek church, written in the circle of the papal court during the endeavour to reconcile the Greek and Roman Churches at the Councils of Ferrara and Florence (1437\endash 1439).}

