\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 ff. 174\endash 269, written space 151 x 100 mm. Frame-ruled in ink for long lines, but ff. 174\endash 184 written in 2 columns, ca. 37 lines. Remains of prickings in upper, lower and outer margins. I\endash VIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Traces of catchwords along lower edge to right of center, verso. ff. 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  written by a single scribe in hybrida (with loops); text ff. 268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 269\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  added by less skilled scribes. Plain initials, and initial strokes, in red, for ff. 174r\endash 176r; headings in red.}

