\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 6r1, 9) \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 2.5: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anonymous:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  Quomodo gemmae lustrantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Omnis gemma durioris nature sicut iacinctus smaragdus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 Ends f. 6r1, 47. \endash  TK col. 985, noted in a Canonici manuscript in the Bodleian Library.}

