\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 6r1, 47) \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 2.6: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anonymous:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  Partly identified alchemical procedures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , as noted. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quomodo fiat margarita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de semine alkoti.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tere semen alkoti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 Unidentified procedure, another version of which is written of f. 13r2, q.v. (f. 6r2, 11) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad dissolvendum Talc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (line 12, left) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Talc in vase\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 repositum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 6r2, 33) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lapis rubeus habens.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Colorem auri.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (line 34, left) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sume salis optimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 This procedure has been reported by Corbett I, p. 299, Recette 2, from Paris, BN, MS lat. 6514; another version is also found in the present manuscript, f. 13r1, 35, q.v. (f. 6r2, 46) \u8230 \'85 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sublimatio almarcaside.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sume al\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 marcasitam et tere et madefac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in aceto quod ex vino constet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 This procedure occurs again in the present manuscript in a differing version on f. 13v2, 42, q.v. (f. 6v1, 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quomodo fit zafurandum ferreum. Sume limature ferri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 6v1, 16) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consolidacio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Sume ungam eream\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [sic for aeream, as frequently in this MS] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et unge ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 aceto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

