\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 10v1, 12) \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 2.8: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anonymous:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  Partly identified alchemical procedures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , as noted. Beginning here is a collection of unidentified procedures and descriptions of materials, a few of which have been printed from a Paris MS by Corbett, and four of which are different versions of procedures which also occur earlier in the present manuscript. Ends f. 15v2, 35. A list follows. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad aurum de gotto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe zelverem purum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vitrum quod fit in eraclia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 11r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aquam de uzifur sic facies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Salis armoniaci mitte partem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in scutellam vitratam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In fimo faciendo invenies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sal armoniacus dupliciter invenitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Baurac est multis modis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alumen multis est modis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 11v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sal alkali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Argentum vivum dicitur azoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Thutie .iij. sunt species.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  See Corbett I, p. 301, no. 15. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Antimonium est alkofol nigrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Attincar genus est salis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sal pluribus est modis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 atque diversorum colorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 12r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 AEs calidum est et siccum atque crassum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aurum calidum est et subtile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Argentum frigidum est et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 siccum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vitrum inter lapides tale existit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iacincti tres sunt species\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Corneolus asportatur de terra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 abamen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Magra duobus modis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Coralli duo sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ematites de monte thabor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 asportatus qui est super fluvium Jordanis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Plumbum est argenti species\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sulphuris .4. sunt species\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 12v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aspaltum ab alarach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [corrected to \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 alairach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 asportatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Flos eris ex utroque fit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  See Corbett I, p. 301, nos. 12, 13. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sal armoniacus sic fit de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fuligine furni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Uzifur fit hoc modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 13r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lapis colorem auri habens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic fit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 For another version see f. 6r2, 33 of this MS; also see Corbett 1, p. 299, no. 2. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sulfur rubeum sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut ferrum molle in calibem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [sic] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mutetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 See Corbett I, p. 299, no. 1. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Margarita ex semine alkoti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 For another version see f. 6r1, 48 of this MS. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Talc solvitur hoc modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 AEs ustum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 See Corbett I, p. 301, no. 11. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sericon sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 13v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Azul fit hoc modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 See Corbett I, pp. 299\endash 300, \u182 \'b6 no. 3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Attinkar sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Zafaran de ferro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Plumbum preparatum hoc modo fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Plumbum fit album\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc modo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  See Corbett I, p. 300, no. 4. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Talc calcinatur hoc modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sublimacio almarcaside\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 For another version see f. 6r2, 46 above. (f. 14r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Res fusa albificatur hoc modo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  See Corbett I, p. 300, no. 5. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aureus novus sic fit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  See Corbett 1, p. 300, no. 6. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Novum fiet vetus sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arsenicum preparatur hoc modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arsenicum quid est succum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in colore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut sandaraca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arsenicum citrinum fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rubeum sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Albificatio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in alio mundacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 litargij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 14v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sulphur preparatur sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sulphur albificatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et ab eo removetur color hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut cuiuslibet rei colorem in aureum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mutes colorem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  See Corbett I, p. 300, no.7. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consolidacio. Ungam eream\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 For another version see above, f. 6v1, 16. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lune confeccio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 See Corbett I, p. 300, no. 8. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item alia confeccio zelveris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . See Corbett I, p. 300, no. 9. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sume unius aurei pondus de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 citrino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 15r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum nobile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de zel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aliud capitulum de zel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Argentum vivum congelatur hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum urceoli rasis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 15v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item aliud de zel. Sume stanni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item aliud de zel. Auricalcum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 durum et album\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aliud capitulum de zel. Sume laminas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ferri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 15v2, 34) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nichil addit ponderi ipsius intellige hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [inserted] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et scies. Explicit.}

