\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 67r1, 15) \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 2.14: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anonymous:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  Unidentified alchemical procedures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De luna.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe stanni uncias. 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 Followed by three additional procedures, >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De Luna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rex persarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe thutiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe markasite albe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (f. 67r2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alius modus augmentacionis lune.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe eris partem .j.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85; then, >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sole et luna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe eris limaturam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85; then, >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aqua dissolvens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe sal panis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; then, >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe croci ferri calcinati.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Ending f. 67v1, 8: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Idem potest facere de luna.}

