\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 76r2, 10) \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 2.18: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anonymous:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  Unidentified alchemical procedures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod cuiuslibet salis et atrimentorum resolucio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 absque labore et decoccione.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Mostly very short. The others begin: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad faciendum salem armoniacum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad faciendum lazurium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Separacio solis et lune\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut aurum plurimum coloreatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item antimonium mixtum venere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Ends f. 76r2, 40.}

