\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 76v) \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 2.20: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anonymous:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  Twelve unidentified practical procedures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Headline (in the fifteenth-century Bastarda): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber secundus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  It appears that the fifteenth-century reader thought the following passages, continuing to the end of the codex, formed parts of a single work; he noted the beginning of a third book on f. 85v and of a fourth on f. 87r, where in fact the text so indicates; it is not known, however, how this material interrelates. (f. 76v1, 29) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dometrius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 philosophus intencionem suam perduxit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 76v1, 37) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rasius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 id ipsum effecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 76v2, 1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mirabile nimis est quod acetum acerrimum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 76v2, 11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Limaturem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quantum volueris accipe et pone in cocliari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ferreo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 76v2, 26) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Marcasite albe partem .j. litargiri partem mediam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 76v2, 35) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe arsenicum sublimatum et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pondus suum salis praeparati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 76v2, 46) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut arsenicum vivum malleabile fiat sicut argentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 77r1, 8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aqua accuta dealbans metalla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 77r1, 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De purgacione ac mollificacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cupri. Extingue ipsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 77r1, 18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De stanno ad modum argenti dealbato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 77r1, 23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Notandum est quod multum valent aque acute\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 77r1, 30) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Notandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod sales et alumina calcinata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 77r1, 38) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qua utere in omnibus operationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tuis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Possibly a single text.}

