\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 26r[14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], 20) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 9.6: Anonymous, Vocabulary of scient\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 i\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 fic terms\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Latin and Czech, not identified. \u182 \'b6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De. .A. vocabula.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Then in two columns, f. 26r(14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )1, 21: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aduista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 kychawka. Ascolonia. luk. Archangelica .dubraiva.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \u8230 \'85 Ends f. 33v(22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )2, 23: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De .Z. Zucosaria .idest. flos agni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 The vocabulary ends, line 27.}

