\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 40r[28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], 12) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 9.11: Anonymous, Synonyms\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 for various substances\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Latin and transliterated Arabic. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Argentum vivum azot. vortatit, Cubat. vdragiros, Albocta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 Ends f. 40v(29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), 26: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Talk. idest. vitriolum Saturnj\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 aliquos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (flourish) \endash  Possibly with some occasional Czech meanings inserted, not identified.}

