\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 40v[29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], 27) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 9.12: Anonymous, Medical\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  and alchemical recipes and procedures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Latin, not identified. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Secuntur nomina planetarum. Saturnus posin idest vsarub\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  The unidentified text includes the basic alchemical symbols for the planets and signs of the Zodiac, ending f. 41r(29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), 8. (f. 41r[29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], 9) Space left for the rubric at the end of the preceding line has not been filled in. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe unam partem aque mercurij fixi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 41r[29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], 22) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Fixatio sulphuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 A very extended series of alchemical and medical procedures follows, nearly all anonymous but including mention of \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Magister ffulcius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  and \ldblquote a Franciscan brother\rdblquote  on f. 49v(38)\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \ldblquote Distinctio viij\rdblquote  by Cyprianus and the Abbot of St. Peter\rquote s at Paris (or Pisa ?) on f. 51(39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). The series ends f. 52v (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), 18, with four verses: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Comoda sunt multa mortalibus agnita musa. Serpentes belue volucres revocantur abira\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [?] \u8230 \'85}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

