\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 52v[41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], 22) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 9.13: Anonymous, Notes on dangerous days of the year\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Latin, not identified. Brief notes, not transcribed, concerning the dangerous days of the year, comparable to the passage on f. 92r(80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 ) by K\u345 \'f8i\u353 \'9a\u357 \'9d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 an described below, but much shorter and not transcribed. Ends line 28.}

