\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 160r[148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], 1) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 9.24: Magister Alexander, Virtutes ac\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 proprietates mensium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Magister Allexander phisicus Egregius in hoc tractatulo describit virtutes ac proprietates mensuum per circulum anni et primo de Ianuario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est enim Ianuarius primus mensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (f. 162r[150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], 31) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quia moderatio. et abstinentia. Sunt viciorum extirpacio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  TK 841 and 652, noted from manuscripts at Vienna and Munich. Alexander was mentioned also at f. 145r(133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), 13.}

