\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 277r\endash 317v) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 9.30: Anonymous, A list of scientific terms\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Latin with German equivalents, not identified. The remaining leaves in the volume are unfoliated, but are ruled for and mostly written in two columns by the original scribe of the codex; through f. 317v is written an untitled and very extensive vocabulary of scientific terms in Latin with full German equivalents for most of the list, in which the distinction is apparently made between those words which have occurred within the present codex and those which have not; though untitled at the beginning, rubrics in the course of the text describe it as \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Synonyma qua praehibita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85; ends f. 317v2, 32: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Zuccara rosarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In B.}

