\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Paper codex in German, 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 212 x 150, ff. 80, paginated in ink by an eighteenth-century hand; no signatures preserved, catchwords at quire-endings; narrow strips of parchment reinforcing the sewing at the midpoint of each quire. Collation: (1\endash 8)\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . One column about 145 x 100, faintly bordered in plumbate, 22\endash 25 lines, no headlines. Written throughout by a very fine and bold German gothic cursive hand, the headings and capitals (a few decorated) in red throughout, the text in dark brown to black ink, moderately abbreviated with standard forms. Virtually without correction. Watermarks of perhaps two differing batches of paper obscured by folds, trimmed, and unclear.
