\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Front pastedown: Erased inscription of seven lines at head of pastedown written in a gothic cursive about 1500, not read. Below:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Zur Erinnerung an den 43\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ten\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Hochzaitstag von deinem Vater Anton Pachinger. Linz am 20. J\u228 \'e4nner 1895\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Remainder blank. (f. 1r) Bookseller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \rquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 s pagination and author notes in pencil. (f. 1v) In a nineteenth-century hand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Ant Pachinger. Linz 1863\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Remainder blank.}

