\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [K. S.: Six watermarks: hand: watermark twins (H1 and H2): hand (H1): most likely =\~WZIS DE7635-PO-155356 (1514, L\u252 \'fcneburg), most likely =\~WZIS DE4500-PO-155625 (1515, Roermond), ~\~WZIS NL0360-PO-155287 (1517, Arnhem), ~\~WZIS DE8085-PO-155300 (1521, o. O.) and hand (H2): ~\~WZIS DE7635-PO-155179 (1514, Kopenhagen), ~\~WZIS DE4620-PO-155275 (1515, Riga), ~\~WZIS EE7185-PO-155325 (1515, Narwa), ~\~WZIS EE7185-PO-155430 (1522, Bremen); watermark twins (H3 and H4): watermarks only in fragments: not identifiable; double-headed eagle (A1 und A2): not identifiable   \u183 \'b7   quire formula: 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + 2 VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 32\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + VII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 46\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 58\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + VII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 72\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 84\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + VII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 98\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + 3 VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 134\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + IV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 142\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  + (IV\endash 1)\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 149\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; seven single leaves inserted, but uncounted (one leaf each between folio 9/10, 35/36, 36/37, 48/49, 49/50, 70/71, 94/95), in different sizes   \u183 \'b7   f. 1\endash 4 and 7\endash 8 lacking: loss of text   \u183 \'b7   contemporary foliation in ink (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 5\endash 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 9\endash 132\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ), modern pencil foliation (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 133\endash 149\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ), first two folios are foliated \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  and \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , foliation jumps to \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  then (there must be pages cut out, f. 5\endash 6 left blank)   \u183 \'b7   writing area: 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 9,4 x 5,5\endash 5,6; 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 9,5\endash 9,7 x 5,4\endash 5,6   \u183 \'b7   9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 19\endash 20 lines; 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 20\endash 21 lines; 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 22\endash 24 lines; 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 27\endash 32 lines   \u183 \'b7   9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : humanistic minuscule script; 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (additions): cursive script   \u183 \'b7   one hand, additions in an eighteenth-century hand (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ); marginal notes in the writer\rquote s hand or in the hand that has written the additions   \u183 \'b7   rubricated; headlines and paragraph marks in red and blue; manuscript shows traces of usage, stained, paper water-stained throughout in the lower and upper margins.]}

