\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 4v, 1) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 27.2: Anonymous, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De lapide ematice}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Latin, unidentified. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Narracio de lapide ematice rectificantem tincturam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Scias vero, quod non fit tinctura aliqua perfecta, nisi cum lapide ematice rubeo, qui lapis deponit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (f. 5v, 15) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nunc autem tibi dico de operacione lapidis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Quid autem de operacione lapidis de philozophico secreto plus dicam. Hic est enim lapis qui seipsam interficit proprie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (f. 9r, 2) \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Et vide quot semper res Gopheff \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [sic]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et Rubeas imponas. Et sic est finis. Sit laus altissimi qui vivit in secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Remainder of f. 9 blank.}

