\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx900\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 10r, 1) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 27.3: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Khalid ibn Yazid}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber trium verborum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Latin. Heading in R\u246 \'f6sel\rquote s hand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Rodianus philosophus. Alij vocant eum Rodamus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 By the original copyist\rquote s hand: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber trium verborum. Lapis iste de quo fit hoc opus habet in se omnes colores. Est enim albus rubeus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \u8230 \'85 (f. 10v, 15) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic est liber trium verborum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Liber lapidis preciosi qui est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (f. 15r, 6) \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Laudetur ergo sublimis deus qui tantum creavit ex re vilissima. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 By R\u246 \'f6sel\rquote s hand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Explicit liber trium verborum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 TK }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 810, etc.}

