\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 30r, 1) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 27.7: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps-Albertus Magnus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Semita recta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Latin. In a different sixteenth-century hand from that of the text following, one word:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . By an older, unidentified scribal hand: Prologue (without the beginning): <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Um multas regiones atque provincias, necnon civitates et castella causa sciencie, quae nuncupatur \u8218 \'82Alchimia\rquote , maximo labore perlustraverim \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 [K. S.:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  scientes quod post operacionem vestram maxima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 31r, 1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sequetur utillitas. Amicos multos habebitis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et qui in ipsam vigilat et laborat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 31r, 7) Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Nunc autem qualiter ad tanti operis laborem accedere debeatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \u8230 \'85 (f. 65r, 18) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item in hac arte vocat Aristoles \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [sic]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  corpora metallorum lapides sicut ipse dicit in libro de posito exemplum quattuor. Qui scit mortificare et post mortem vivificare esset dominus. Finitus sabbato ante conductum pasce etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 In another hand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  velis vitri est anatron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  [K. S.: Druck: Opera omnia, ed. A. Borgnet, Bd. 37, Paris 1898, S. 545\endash 573 (mit h\u228 \'e4ufigen Abweichungen). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Glorieux}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire, no. 6cs; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hamesse/Szyller}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  no. 23056. Gilles G. Meersseman O. P., Introductio in opera omnia B. Alberti Magni O. P., Br\u252 \'fcgge 1931, S. 147 f.] f. 65v blank. \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 TK}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  319, etc.}

