\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Front pastedown: Originally blank; now with Duveen\rquote s bookplate on red paper, his characteristic number, pencil notes by a modern, Germanic hand, and eighteenth-century inscription,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Schmid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , with a shelf mark below possibly in the same hand:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  N\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  319\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (f. 1r, 1) Written as a title:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Register vber das Buoch 1528 Jar. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Below, in an eighteenth-century hand, very likely that of\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Schmid \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 who signed his name on the front pastedown, is this inscription:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  dyes Buch und edle Manuscript hebe im Monath Jener anno 1737 Preis 120 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [K. S.:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Virer \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= denomination of coin, dt.: M\u252 \'fcnzeinheit)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  an\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  mich gebracht. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Remainder of f. 1 blank. On ff. 2\endash 17 is a neatly written\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Register \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 of the contents of the leaves originally written and numbered by the copyist\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cclxxxxviiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 f. 18 is blank.}

