\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 180[162]r) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anonymous, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Alchemy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in German, not identified. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Wilt du machen das aqua mercurialis. Item.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Wiltu machen dz aqua mercurialis, so nym ii lot vitriol \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (f. 200[182]r, 3)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  zwischen gerecht vnd vngerecht, wann die natur hellt es nicht zuo dem vngerechten aber mit der kunst, muo\u223 \'df man es pringen zuo der gerechtigkait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Remainder of f. 200(182) blank.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 201[183]r)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 30.6: Various, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Alchemical recipes and procedures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , mostly in German, but a few in Latin, nearly all anonymous but a few ascribed to named practitioners, as indicated. Heading: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aqua lune pars cum parte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Gold]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  vnd \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Silver]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Erstlich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  laminier die luna vff pfening dick vnd mach s.s.s. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [? not understood]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  mit den plechlin vnd prepariertem salltz \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 This opening marks the beginning of a very long series of alchemical recipes and procedures, none of which have been traced in the literature consulted, although a few have been identified by the copyist: on f. 205(187) are two procedures attributed to {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Conrat Oschwalt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Oschwald\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , a goldsmith of\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Schwatz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; on ff. 218\endash 219(200\endash 201) is a lengthy procedure ascribed to {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Maister Lienhart}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , goldsmith of\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Villach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; on f. 262(244)v is a procedure by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hainrich Nasperger}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . In all, there are nearly two hundred procedures in this section, ending f. 269(251)r, 4: \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  auff aim test, so habt ir ewer silber berait etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 269[251]r, 6) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 30.7: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Raimundus Lullus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , Extracts\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , seemingly from his {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Experimenta}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 and\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Testamentum novissimum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , not identified with certainty, translated into German, the first by or received from {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Jobst Trutw\u255 \'ffn}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (or Trautwein). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Von Jobsten Trutw\u255 \'ffn. Die recht ware kunst Ra\u255 \'ffmundi v\u223 \'dfzogen vff rot vnd wy\u223 \'df, ain werck auff vier monat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Nym iiii lot f\u255 \'ffn silber calcinirt, wol gewaschen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (f. 270[252]v, 17) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ain annder gantz gerecht werck Raymundi, besser vnd subtyler dann das vorig gewesen ist.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \u8230 \'85 (f. 272[254]r, 3) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hernach volgt ain ware, gerechte pratica, lunam in fe\u255 \'ffn gold zuo verwanndlen. Da merck eben auff.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \u8230 \'85 (f. 274[256]v, 9) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Elixir vnnd oleum solis, das congeliert vnd figiert vnd tingirt mercurium vnd alle metall in das aller f\u255 \'ffnist gold obreisen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \u8230 \'85 Ends f. 276(258)v, 18:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  In dem klainen stuck hapt ir die gr\u246 \'f6ste haimlichait der wellt Raymundus. Lobt es vff das h\u246 \'f6chst.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (f. 277[259]r) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 30.8: Various, Fifty-one \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 alchemical procedures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in German. Heading: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ain luna fix vnnd ain augment, das nymmer mangelt gerecht vnnd offt bewert. N\u255 \'ffm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  lebendigen kalch, vnnd von ki\u223 \'dfling ist der besst, gu\u223 \'df daruber siben mal als schwer ha\u255 \'ff\u223 \'df siedend wassers \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 This passage opens a series of fifty-one procedures, none of which have been traced in the literature consulted, although a few have been identified by the copyist: on f. 282(264), an\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Augment \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Enndris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 (Andreas) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Werner}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; on f. 287(269) a procedure by\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  doctor {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas von Wasserburg}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  [K. S.: Gundolf Keil, Thomas von Wasserburg, in: Verfasserlexikon, Bd. 9, Berlin \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1995, col. 892\endash 893 (MS mentioned col. 893)]; on ff. 293\endash 295 (275\endash 277) two recipes and one reduction ascribed to {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gottfridus Himelreich}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . The original portion of the manuscript closes with a procedure by Niclaus of Sweden, beginning, f. 317(299)v, heading: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ain kunst von gold von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Niclaus von Schwede}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Nyem k\u246 \'f6sselbruon oder den safran \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 Ends line 14:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  bring die pulver in die luna, so hast du warlich gold darinn. Von mir, Niclaus von Schwede.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  There are many notes in a rough eighteenth-century hand in German on the remainder of this page and on ff. 318\endash 321. There are notes in pencil in a German hand, possibly dated 1841, on the last leaf and the final pastedown, which also has some writing of eighteenth-century date, not transcribed; ff. 322\endash 346 are blank. \endash  A few procedures ascribed to individuals named in the text as noted above, the remainder anonymous, none otherwise identified. The way in which the final recipe is both headed as being by Niclaus of Sweden, and at its conclusion seemingly subscribed by him, suggests that he was the copyist of the original portions of the manuscript. The later hand is unidentified.}

