\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Original stiff parchment over paper boards, remnants of two thong ties on the upper cover, slits for similar ties, now missing, on the lower cover; front cover lettered in very faded gothic script, apparently by the scribe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 PROBIER BUCH ANDREAS OBERLENDER 1532\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . A title has also been supplied by a modern hand in old style on the backstrip. Plain edges.}

