\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 f. 401ra\endash rb \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Orationes ad sanctam Birgittam\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [K. S.: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oracio de beata Birgitta.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gaude, Birgitta sancta, canticum tibi debetur glorie. Deduc in refrigerium de lacu nos mise\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 - (f. 401rb) -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rie. O Birgitta, mater pia, contristatis in hac via tua da remedia. Pro hoc tenebrosum mare duc nos, quo possimus clare videre celestia. O sponsa Christi, redolens ut mirra suavissima, errori nostro condolens patrona sis mitissima. Ora pro nobis beata Birgitta, sponsa Christi, electa ut ad celestem primam sit ipse nobis via recta. Collecta ut supra.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item oracio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Awe Birgitta, sponsa Christi, vernans rosa mater egregia, nos per tua suffragia ad sanctorum fer collegia. Ora pro nobis etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Collecta.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deus, qui beate Birgitte secreta celorum pandisti, presta nobis eius meritis ut celorum secreta in agone videre mereamur per Christum dominum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Compilation from the office of Birger Gregersson, amongst others. Ed.: Carl-Gustaf Undhagen, Birger Gregerssons Birgitta-Officium, Uppsala 1960. For details see Undhagen, Sancta Birgitta. Revelaciones. Book I, see above, p.\~179, n.\~7.]}

