\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx720\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs26\lang1033 \'96\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 (f.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 73rv) [K. S.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Prayer to the Virgin with indulgence\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , attributed to Pope Sixtus IV.] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Von dem nachuolgenden gepet hat pabst Syxtus xi tausent iar ablas.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Gegruest seyst aller heiligiste Maria, muter gots, kunigin der himel, ain porten des paradei\u223 \'df\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 [K. S.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 du pist ain rayne iunckfraw\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pit fur mein s\u252 \'fcndt. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  See above f. 59rv.]}

