\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [K. S.: With only few exceptions, the order of the prayers corresponds to M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Cod. ms. 269, ff. 122r\endash 172v and M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, Cgm 2961, ff. 85v\endash 98r (both from Tegernsee); some prayers, in different order, also in M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, Cgm 4285, ff. 189v\endash 197v; 212r\endash 216r (from Tegernsee).]}

