\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Paper (sturdy; watermarks buried in the gutter), ff. iii (paper) + i (contemporary paper) + 233 + iii (paper), 200 x 150 (ca. 135 x 95) mm. Written in 15\endash 16 long lines, ruled in hard point, single vertical bounding lines only   \u183 \'b7   I\endash XXVIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . First 4 folios of quire signed in lower margin, recto (e.g., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Bij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Biij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , etc.)   \u183 \'b7   Written by one scribe in cursive script   \u183 \'b7   Headings in large gothic textura, with flourishes.}

