\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 f. 1rv [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Biblia sacra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], fragment. Extant 1r: Lam 3,13\endash 34; 1v: 3,35\endash 51 (52\endash 56 obscured). \u9553 \'a6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Misit in renibus meis filias faretrae suae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oculus meus depraedatus est animam meam in cunctis filiabus urbis meae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6 \endash  A large portion of the verso is covered by a fragment of\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 a 15th century German manuscript glued to the leaf in an attempt at repair.}

