\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 1r\endash 12v \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Calendar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Latin, including the feasts of Basilius (1 Jan.), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anniuersarium patrem et matrem ordinis nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (6 Feb.), Translation of Augustine (28 Feb.), Suitbert (1 March), Heribert (16 March), Translation of Monica (9 April), Monica (4 May, in red), Conversion of Augustine (5 May, in red), Michael archangel (8 May), Canonization of Nicolas of Tolentino (5 June), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anniuersarium fratrum et sororum ordinis nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (7 July), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Festum niuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (5 Aug.), Augustine (28 Aug., in red), Octave of Augustine (4 Sept.), Nicolas of Tolentino (10 Sept., in red), Michael Archangel (29 Sept., in red.), Translation of Augustine (11 Oct.), 11,000 Virgins (21 Oct., in red), Cordula (22 Oct.), Cunibert (12 November).}

