\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Binding: s. xv\endash xvi. Original sewing on three thick, double, vegetable fiber cords laced and pegged in grooves in wooden boards. The grooves for the endband cores, which are also vegetable fiber, start on the spine edge of the boards. The spine of the bookblock is cut off at an angle at head and tail so the braided endbands extend very little beyond the edges. The spine is square and lined all along with tawed skin which extends to the inside of the boards. Covered in tawed skin, originally pink, with two labels at the head of the upper board; on the first, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Passionale ad aduentum domini usque ad festum mathie sancte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 sermonum collectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [?], on the second, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 G.27\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Five round bosses on each board and two strap and pin fastenings, the pins on the upper one. Lower board detached, bosses and fastenings wanting.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Front pastedown: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Brief description of the 15 days before judgment\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Prima die eriget se mare xl cubitus super altitudinem moncium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 hec signa scripsit ysidorus xv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller, v. 7, no. 10333.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Back pastedown. A bifolium from an unidentified 15th century German manuscript on paper, beginning: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Zu dem raben dw solt mir chwnden vnd sagen wo hestu den herren werleichen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... One leaf: 148 x 103 (93 x 60) mm., written in 14\endash 15 long lines.}

