\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Paper (watermarks similar to Piccard Ochsenkopf VII. 151), ff. 250 (contemporary foliation in upper right corner, 1\endash 229, in Roman numerals) + ii (paper; ii = back pastedown), 272 x 200 (210 x 140) mm. Folios 1\endash 25 written in 35\endash 39 long lines, the remainder in 2 cols., 36\endash 39 lines. Frame-ruled in lead.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , III\endash XX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , XXI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?). Signatures for second and third gatherings (small Roman numerals) on recto.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Written in a cursive book hand by a single scribe. Numerous annotations to the text in margins by a later hand.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Two uninspired initials, 7- and 5-line, in red with crude penwork in green. Plain initials, headings and rubrics in red.}

