\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Parchment (badly stained and rubbed from use in a binding)   \u183 \'b7   4 folios (fols. 1 and 4 and fols. 2 and 3 form bifolia)   \u183 \'b7   Fols. 1 and 4 measure 105 x 100 mm; fol. 2 measures 142 x 100 mm; fol. 3 measures 143 x 102 mm (written space 96 x 60 mm)   \u183 \'b7   1 column   \u183 \'b7   19 lines, with 17 lines remaining on fols. 1 and 4. Ruling in lead. Single vertical bounding lines   \u183 \'b7   Written in gothic script (littera textualis)   \u183 \'b7   1-line initials are in black capitals highlighted with red and are not set apart from the text. Sections within the \ldblquote Rhythmica oratio\rdblquote  are marked by paragraph marks in red. Rubrics in the prayers are written in black minuscule and underlined in red. Punctuation consists of the punctus. Hyphenation is in the same ink as the text.}

