\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4500\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 3r\endash 4v [K. S.: Mystic prayers based on the tract \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Von der \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \u220 \'dc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 berfahrt der Gottheit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  by \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Meister Eckhart\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \u9553 \'a6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 herre, daz du got, vnser herre, bist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vnd glouben von der kraft des vaters enphahe verm\u250 \'fagentheit aller dinge, da ich m\u250 \'fage sprechen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Omnia possum in eo qui me confortat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [Phil 4,13].< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (f. 4r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 herre, nu minne in mir, bekenne in mir vnd w\u250 \'farke in mir ein stilles swigen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 me belibet. Ein entsinken p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6 \endash  The lower margin of fol. 4 has been trimmed with the loss of the bottom two lines of text. (f. 4v) \u9553 \'a6[\u8230 \'85]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 esenden, ein leben der lebenden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ieze gedenkest,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [\u8230 \'85]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 den du\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [\u8230 \'85] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 niemer vergessen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6 \endash  Fol. 4v is badly stained and is illegible in many places. The lower margin has been trimmed with the loss of the bottom two lines of text. \endash  [K. S.: For author and works see Kurt Ruh, Geschichte der abendl\u228 \'e4ndischen Mystik, vol. 3, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1996, pp. 216\endash 353; Kurt Ruh, Meister Eckhart, in: Verfasserlexikon, vol. 2, Berlin \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1980, col. 327\endash 348. For text reference for the tract by Meister Eckhart see Deutsche Mystiker des Vierzehnten Jahrhunderts, vol. 2: Meister Eckhart, ed. Franz Pfeiffer, Leipzig 1857, p. 506, l. 10; p. 507, ll. 34\endash 40; p. 508, ll. 3\endash 4; for the tract see Peter Schmitt, \u8218 \'82Von der \u252 \'fcbervart der gotheit\rquote , in: Verfasserlexikon, vol. 9, Berlin \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1995, col. 1205\endash 1209.]}

