\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Parchment, one leaf, cut in half vertically, 360 x 280 (250 x 170) mm. 2 columns of 54 to 56 lines. Frame-ruled in brown ink with double vertical, single horizontal bounding lines, all full length and full across. Written in gothic cursive script. Plain initials alternate in red and blue; headings and initials in red. Guide-letters for plain initials. Rubbed and stained on verso with some loss of text.}

