\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Written in Southern Germany at the beginning of the 15th century according to K. Schneider. Inscription on verso, inner margin \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 St\u252 \'fcfft Buch pro anno 1657\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  indicates that leaf was used for a 17th-century binding. Early modern provenance otherwise unknown. Acquired by H. P. Kraus from the private collection of Bernhard Bischoff. Purchased from Kraus in 1965 by Edwin J. Beinecke for the Beinecke Library.}

