\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 From the Auersperg Library: see the handwritten ex-libris on f. Iv: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Wolfgangi Engelberti Sacri Romani Imperii Comitis ab Aursperg. Catalogo inscriptus anno 1655\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . The Auersperg shelf number \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  is written on the inside front cover. Collection of A. R. A. Hobson, London. Purchased on the Edwin J. Beinecke fund from Laurence Witten in 1984.}

