\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 1r\endash 40v \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Ps.-Jerome (Ps.-Hieronymus Stridonensis), Interpretationes nominum Hebraicorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt interpretaciones Ieronimi Hebraicorum nominum super Bibliam, quibusdam aliis vocabulis et eorundem exposicionibus intermixtis, et primo quod post a sequitur a. Aaz: apprehendens vel apprehensio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [this lemma deleted]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aad: testificans vel testimonium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Zuzim: consiliantes eos vel consiliatores eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [in another hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nomen viri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt interpretaciones Byblie sancti Ieronimi doctoris per manus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [name not added]. \endash  Lambert, BHM, 402. Numerous corrections and marginal additions; the latter refer to the folio numbers and letters of sections on ff. 144r\endash 157r, where the same names are dealt with. ff. 41r\endash 61v blank.}

