\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 f. 81r \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Regimen sanitatis Salernitanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , shortened version. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anglorum regi scripsit scola tota Salerni. Si vis incolomem, si te vis reddere sanum, Curas linque graves, irasci crede prophanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut non egrotes, inter duo fercula potes. Sepe minge parum, si vis bonus esse viarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Walther, Initia 1039; Thorndike and Kibre 95\endash 96. The full text in S. de Renzi, Collectio Salernitana, v. 5, Naples 1859, pp. 1\endash 104.}

