\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 87\endash 94r \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Alchemical vocabulary\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Achel, id est furnus. Anat, id est ferrum purgatum (unde fit argentum alchimicum). Affreb, id est Saturnus. Alkay, id est stagnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Zanco, id est Mercurius. Zoar, id est anseat vel oleum basamarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Followed on f. 94r by an alchemical diagram, more terms and a recipe. Written in 3 columns a page, the columns numbered by alphabets as on ff. 83r\endash 86r. ff. 94v\endash 99r blank.}

