\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 f. 143v Various short texts. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota libros Byblie cum capitulis suis. Genesis L, Exodus XL\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iohannis prima V, Iohannis secunda I, Iohannis tercia I. Summa capitulorum 1178\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et nota quod Aquila fuit primus interpres ex Hebreo in Grecum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Postea sine hiis transtulit Ioronimus ultimo de Hebreo in Latinum, cuius edicio nunc ubique servatur a nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota hic litteras Hebraicas secundum ordinem alfabeti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < ...: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alef, beth, gimel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... The Hebrew letter signs follow; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Supra locum ubi crucifixus est Dominus hoc scriptum est Grece: O theos basileos ysmos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 (Hic Deus rex noster ...)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hoc scriptum est Grece ubi crux fuit fixa in petra: Thyo rystis basys\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 (Quam vides fundamentum ...)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota versus de X plagis. Prima rubens unda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Walther, Initia 14595; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item nota alios versus. Sunt dicte vestes polimite multicolores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... 3 verses on the fabric \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 polymitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pauset in Elisio delubri conditor huius,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si chos ab exicio defendat kiria cuius.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dat michi Scriptura quod spiritualia iura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Servem sub cura, quem turbat acucula dura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Poem, 9 verses; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sed quid ad Christum generacio Ioseph ex David est deducta, cum Christus non ex semine Iosef sit ortus\~? Respondetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; Compiler\rquote s hand: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota hic quedam regna precipue Christianorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Regnum Rome, scilicet imperium. Regnum Francie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...}

