\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 162r\endash 168r \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Michael Scotus (?), De XXXVI imaginibus et XII signis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De noticia ordinum stellarum fixarum celi seu ymagynum 48 que a philosophis veraciter dinoscuntur multo intellectu experimentorum in arte stellarum, que aliter constellacio nominatur, et que in nocte serena patenter apparent, licet non simul omnes nec una et eadem hora. Phylosophy quidam multis experimentis noverunt celum esse stellatum ordinabiliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (f. 163r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aries habet stellas multas inter quas 20 sunt pervisibiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  De XXXVI imaginibus et XII signis attributed to Michael Scotus (d. 1235), Thorndike and Kibre 133; see also 1041.}

