\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ff. 1\endash 76. Paper, 290 x 210 mm. Watermarks: balance, var. Piccard, Waage V.331 (?); star, var. Briquet 6077 (?). Narrow parchment stays in the middle of the quires   \u183 \'b7   I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\endash 1, 2, 3, 11, 12; ff. 1\endash 7), II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\endash 1; ff. 8\endash 18), III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\endash 5, 6; ff. 19\endash 28), IV\endash VII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (ff. 29\endash 76). Horizontal catchwords at right, close to the lower edge   \u183 \'b7   Quires I\endash III have board ruling for two columns of 38 lines below top line, 200 x 150 mm., intercolumnar space 21 mm. Quires IV\endash VII have frame-ruling in lead for two columns of 40\endash 45 lines, c. 195 x c. 145 mm., intercolumnar space 20 mm. Dimensions (?)   \u183 \'b7   Copied by various hands writing Gothica Cursiva Libraria with Bastarda features   \u183 \'b7   Headings in red, often missing; heightening of the majuscules in red; plain red 4-line initials; they are flourished with black penwork on ff.18v\endash 19r.}

