\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ff. 31v\endash 61v \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Calendar of obits of benefactors of the Convent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . The arrangement and the period covered are the same as on ff. 1r\endash 31r. The mention of the donations and corresponding obligations is often framed in ink. In conformity with f. Av and ff. 62r\endash 63v the mention of obligations (vigils) from the side of the Convent towards a series of benefactors has been cancelled.}

