\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Prosper [Aquitanus]: Epistula ad Augustinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , epist. 225. \endash  Ed.: CSEL 57, S. 454 f. CPL Nr. 262, 516. (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Hilarius [Gallus]: Epistula ad Augustinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , epist. 226. \endash  Ed.: CSEL 57, S. 468. CPL Nr. 262; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 1024 (Ps.-Hilarius Pictaviensis). (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus: De praedestinatione sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 44, Sp. 959. CPL Nr. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 354\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Martinus [Bracarensis]: Formula vitae honestae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Epistula beati Martini Mironi regi Ungarie missa.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Genannt lediglich Incipit und Explicit. \endash  Ed.: Martini episcopi Bracarensis opera omnia, hg. v. Claude W. Barlow, New Haven 1950, S. 237, 249 f. CPL Nr. 1080. (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus: De dono perseverantiae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 45, Sp. 993. CPL Nr. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 355\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus: Epistula ad Dardanum (= De praesentia dei liber)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , epist. 187. \endash  Ed.: CSEL 57, S. 81. CPL Nr. 262. (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus: De utilitate credendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: CSEL 25, S. 3. CPL Nr. 316. (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kompilation aus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus: Liber de gratia Testamenti Novi ad Honoratum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , epist 140, nur Textanfang, und [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus: Retractationum libri duo]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lib. 2, cap. 36, nur Textanfang. \endash  Ed.: CSEL 44, S. 155. CPL Nr. 262. \endash  Ed.: CC 57, S. 119. CPL Nr. 250. 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

