\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Regula sancti Augustini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Regularis Informatio). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic incipit regula beati Augustini patris nostri sanctissimi et gloriosissimi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec sunt que ut observetis precipimus in monasterio constitute. Primum, propter quod estis in unum congregate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et in temptacionem non inducatur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Ed.: Luc Verheijen, La R\u232 \'e8gle de saint Augustin, Bd. 1, Paris 1967, S. 417\endash 437. CPL Nr. 1839b; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3590b.}

