\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 De pulsibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vidende sunt quatuor alteraciones. Si vero pulsat acute \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 doloribus capitis signat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

