\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Guillelmus falconarius und [Dancus Rex]. (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Guillelmus falconarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gullielmus falconerius fuit, qui nutritus fuit in curia regis Rogerii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 medicinas et naturas falconum ancipitrum et astrorum in libello tratavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Dancus Rex.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\endash va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In primis de dolore capitis quod malum vocatur subvertinum. Cum videris claudentem oculos et caput moventem aucellum scias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia ad locum pristrinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 revertertetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Guillelmus falconarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Kapitel 1\endash 8. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum videbis per supradicta singna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que in primo libro diximus quod subvertinum patiatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (expungiert:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  minimam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  minam cum carne porcina detur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cum acu aerea et sanabitur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Ed.: Gunnar Tilander, Dancus Rex. Guillelmus Falconarius. Gerardus Falconarius. Les plus anciens trait\u233 \'e9s de fauconnerie de l\rquote Occident (Cynegetica 9), Lund 1963, S. 134\endash 136 (Guillelmus Falconarius, Prolog, mit Abweichungen), 62\endash 116 (Dancus Rex, mit Abweichungen), 138\endash 144 (Guillelmus Falconarius, Kap. 1\endash 8, mit Abweichungen). CALMA Bd. 3,1, S. 54 (Dancus Rex). Vgl. Van den Abeele, Fauconnerie, S. 23 f. (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  F\u252 \'fcr die Anregungen zur Texterschlie\u223 \'dfung sei Herrn Baudouin Van den Abeele gedankt.}

