\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anweisungen zur Tischlesung f\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 r d\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 as Kart\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 userkloster Engelgarten\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  in W\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 rzburg \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Advent bis Ende des Kirchenjahres). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Directorium lecture refectorii, etc. Ysaias incipitur dominica prima adventus et nichil de eo legitur in refectorio. Et tunc in refectorio legitur residuum beati Gregorii ii columpne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 festum sancti Andree et sancte Katherine et Clementis, ut legantur in refectorio tempore oportuno.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec omnia vera quo ad numerum foliorum in loco quo primo scripta sunt, hic autem non semper habet veritatem, quia, ubi ponuntur hic iii vel quatuor folia libri nostri et quilibet eorum habet quasi sex, sic quod quasi duplum nos habemus in libris nostris ubi hii in grateam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  habent simplum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Kolophon:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  1465 kalendis Septembris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [1. September 1465] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in orto angelorum.}

