\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Autogra\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ph Philipp Melanchthons ([Halle\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , 6. Januar\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  1546): Auslegung zu Johannes 1,29\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Iohannis primo. Ecce agnus dei, qui tollis peccata mundi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Joh 1,29]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Hoc admirandum decretum ex sinu aeterni patris protulit filius dei, dominus noster Iesus Christus, ignotum antea omnibus creaturis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vera vides et vera invocatio, qui sunt veri cultus dei. \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs26 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u943 \'df\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs26 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8052 ? \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs26 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u943 \'df\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Philippus Melanthon 154\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Zeitfuchs, Stolbergische Kirchen- und Stadthistorie, S.\~220\~f.; Corpus Reformatorum 6 (1839), Sp.\~5, Nr.\~3349.}

